              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "s4t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Truck Country and Stoops Freightliner-Western Star, we provide comprehensive mobile repair services to minimize downtime for medium – and heavy-duty trucks across the midwest. As part of one of the largest dealership groups in the U.S., our mobile teams bring dealership-quality expertise directly to you. <strong><em>Mobile Service is not a roadside or emergency response service.</em></strong>",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "paddingTop": 0,
                      "paddingBottom": 0,
                      "marginBottom": "20"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "s4t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our professional Mobile Service team provides scheduled on-site support. We diagnose issues, perform necessary repairs, and ensure your equipment or vehicles are operating safely and efficiently, minimizing downtime and maximizing convenience. Whether you need urgent repairs, routine maintenance, or installation services, our team is equipped to handle a wide range of tasks at your site. We are committed to delivering reliable, high-quality service wherever you are.",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "paddingTop": 0,
                      "paddingBottom": 0
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
